<view class="volunteer-shell">
  <view wx:if="{{!hasResult}}" class="empty-state">
    <view class="empty-title">还没有定位结果</view>
    <view class="empty-copy">请先完成校排定位，再查看冲稳保建议。</view>
    <button class="secondary-button" bindtap="handleBackResult">返回定位结果</button>
  </view>

  <block wx:if="{{hasResult}}">
    <view class="volunteer-hero">
      <text class="eyebrow">下一步 · 志愿初筛</text>
      <view class="volunteer-title">{{payload.input.schoolShortName}} 的冲稳保建议</view>
      <view class="volunteer-copy">
        先根据当前北京市位次区间给出冲、稳、保三档初筛方向。后续还要结合选科、院校专业组和专业限制逐项核对。
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="base-panel">
      <view class="base-label">当前定位区间</view>
      <view class="base-range">{{payload.result.rankRange}}</view>
      <view class="base-meta">{{payload.result.level}}｜置信度 {{payload.result.confidence}}</view>
      <view class="base-subject">选科：{{subjectCombinationLabel}}</view>
    </view>

    <view class="recommendation-list">
      <view wx:for="{{recommendations}}" wx:key="level" class="recommendation-section section-{{item.level}}">
        <view class="recommendation-head">
          <view class="group-mark">{{item.level}}</view>
          <view class="recommendation-title">{{item.title}}</view>
        </view>

        <view wx:if="{{item.items.length === 0}}" class="empty-recommendation">{{item.emptyText}}</view>

        <view wx:for="{{item.items}}" wx:for-item="rec" wx:key="id" class="college-card">
          <view class="college-card-top">
            <view class="college-name">{{rec.collegeName}}</view>
            <view class="level-badge">{{rec.level}}</view>
          </view>
          <view class="college-group">专业组：{{rec.groupName}}｜选科要求：{{rec.subjectRequirement}}</view>
          <view class="college-rank">2025 投档：{{rec.minScore}} 分｜位次 {{rec.minRankText}}</view>
          <view class="college-reason">{{rec.reason}}</view>
          <view class="college-risk">{{rec.riskText}}</view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="notice-panel">
      <view class="notice-title">下一步怎么筛学校？</view>
      <view class="notice-copy">
        当前卡片来自北京教育考试院 2025 本科普通批投档线种子数据。下一步要继续补齐专业明细、招生计划、体检限制和色弱风险。
      </view>
    </view>

    <button class="primary-button compact" bindtap="handleBackResult">返回定位结果</button>
  </block>
</view>
